As we approach mount Kilimanjaro, we cannot help but reflect on our extraordinary journey across the continent.
There is still plenty of untouched wilderness in Africa worth protecting.
But the melting glaciers at the top of the mountain which will completely disappear before the decade is over are a stark reminder as to how fragile our planet really is.
